// "Explore" [CR#701.44a]: the exploring permanent's controller reveals the top
// card of their library. If a land card is revealed, that player puts it into
// their hand; otherwise they put a +1/+1 counter on the exploring permanent and
// MAY put the revealed card into their graveyard.
//
// No dedicated Explore atom — composed from primitives (the house style, cf.
// `Amass.ron`/`Investigate.ron`): bind the top card (`Each` over `TopOfLibrary`
// 1 -> `It`), publicly `Reveal` it (`to` defaults to None = all players
// [CR#701.20a]), then branch on its type. `This` stays the exploring permanent
// (never rebinds inside `Each`), so the counter lands on the creature while the
// hand/graveyard moves act on the revealed card `It`. Revealing never moves the
// card ([CR#701.20b]); a non-land the player keeps stays on top.
(
    name: "Explore",
    template: "explore",
    kinds: [OneShotEffect, KeywordAction],
    body: Composite(
        name: Explore,
        body: Each(
            binder: Existing(TopOfLibrary(count: 1)),
            effect: Sequentially([
                Reveal(what: It),
                If(
                    condition: Matches(It, Type("Land")),
                    then: Move(It, Hand),
                    otherwise: Sequentially([
                        PutCounters(This, P1P1Counter, 1),
                        May(effect: Move(It, Graveyard)),
                    ]),
                ),
            ]),
        ),
    ),
)
